Test name/intent mismatch: this case now excludes the path via `exclusionPatterns`, which is different from a true "offline" scenario (file missing). If the product logic distinguishes "offline" vs "excluded", consider renaming the test (e.g., "should trash excluded assets"), or keep the file-removal approach and add a separate excluded-path test to avoid masking regressions.

